	'ke6738372' => 'How does the author balance detachment with empathy toward strangers?',
	'ke6e424d8' => 'To join our list, provide your name, email address, and preferred edition language (English or Traditional Chinese). You must also confirm your consent to receive literary correspondence from Fumi Press. We maintain a strict policy of calm communication: no advertising partnerships, no promotional clutter, and no data sharing. You can modify your language preferences or unsubscribe at any time by contacting hello@fumipress.example during our studio hours, Mon–Fri 10:00–18:00 GMT+8.',
