	'ke7993a09' => 'Who narrates the audiobook edition and what is its running time?',
	'ke8e73ebf' => 'Small Hours will be officially published on 18 March 2027 in both English and Traditional Chinese editions. Pre-orders close on 10 March 2027. All pre-ordered signed hardcover copies, book-club packs, and launch bundles will ship on 11 March 2027 directly from our studio in Da\'an District, Taipei. Digital editions, including the EPUB ebook and author-read audiobook, will be delivered via email download links on publication day.',
	'kea7fb059' => 'Four evenings, four cities',
	'kea9cf7e4' => 'Shipping',
	'keaa9935a' => 'Physical editions ship worldwide directly from our studio in Da\'an District, Taipei, starting on 11 March 2027. Typical international transit times range from 5 to 12 working days. Customers are responsible for any standard local import duties assessed by their jurisdiction. Should an order arrive damaged or face delivery delays, contact our customer service team at hello@fumipress.example during our studio hours, Monday through Friday 10:00 to 18:00 GMT+8, for resolution within two working days.',
	'keaed2a77' => 'English and Traditional Chinese',
	'keb3a33c2' => '“We read the title essay together in our morning group, and nobody spoke for several minutes after the final line. It gives language to the quietest corners of daily life.”',
